{"task_id": "HumanEval/44", "solution": "def change_base(x: int, base: int):\n    \"\"\"Change numerical base of input number x to base.\n    Returns the string representation after the conversion.\n    \"\"\"\n    if x == 0:\n        return \"0\"\n\n    result_digits = []\n    current_x = x\n    while current_x > 0:\n        remainder = current_x % base\n        result_digits.append(str(remainder))\n        current_x //= base\n    \n    return \"\".join(result_digits[::-1])"}
