{"task_id": "HumanEval/46", "solution": "def fib4(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Computes the n-th element of the Fib4 number sequence iteratively.\n    It calculates fib4(n) = fib4(n-1) + fib4(n-2) + fib4(n-3) + fib4(n-4) without recursion.\"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    if n == 1:\n        return 0\n    if n == 2:\n        return 2\n    if n == 3:\n        return 0\n\n    # Initialize the last four values required for the recurrence relation:\n    # fib4(i-4), fib4(i-3), fib4(i-2), fib4(i-1)\n    f0, f1, f2, f3 = 0, 0, 2, 0\n\n    for i in range(4, n + 1):\n        next_fib = f0 + f1 + f2 + f3\n        # Shift values for the next iteration:\n        # f0 becomes old f1, f1 becomes old f2, f2 becomes old f3, f3 becomes next_fib\n        f0, f1, f2, f3 = f1, f2, f3, next_fib\n\n    return f3"}
