{"task_id": "HumanEval/50", "solution": "def decode_shift(s: str):\n    \"\"\"\n    Decodes a string that was encoded with the encode_shift function.\n    \"\"\"\n    result_chars = []\n    for ch in s:\n        if 'a' <= ch <= 'z':\n            # Shift character back by 5, wrapping around the alphabet\n            # Add 26 to ensure positive result before modulo for negative shifts\n            shifted_ord = (ord(ch) - 5 - ord('a') + 26) % 26 + ord('a')\n            result_chars.append(chr(shifted_ord))\n        else:\n            # Keep non-lowercase characters unchanged\n            result_chars.append(ch)\n    return \"\".join(result_chars)"}
